{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0h5cG9jaG9uZHJpYWMlMjAlMjgyMDIyJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Hypochondriac","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zfQGUJ0p0CdYKBYT5HzuaMxEAtJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2uJ2r36wg4HB4l0eFmMmX1Thzrw.jpg","description":"Will, a young Hispanic gay potter, is one gregarious guy. His boss is terrible, but he's got a great boyfriend and a great job. Unfortunately, behind that veneer is a dark past of violence and mental illness that he is desperate to keep hidden. When his bipolar mother comes out of the woodwork after ten years of silence, he begins exhibiting unexplainable symptoms and spirals into an obsession, determined to solve this mystery of his own. A young potter’s life devolves into chaos as he loses function of his body while being haunted by the physical manifestation of his childhood trauma.","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Horror","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.9","runtime":"96 min","cast":["Zach Villa","Devon Graye","Madeline Zima","Yumarie Morales","Marlene Forte","Chris Doubek","Paget Brewster","Adam Busch"],"director":["Addison Heimann"],"released":"2022-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Zach Villa","character":"Will","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oyJ13yWUmMnmpywV0Z2CJCFvzXV.jpg"},{"name":"Devon Graye","character":"Luke","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kVqBgzkjWNaNFmXSJ7MLI3jOMOT.jpg"},{"name":"Madeline Zima","character":"Blossom","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6hmUs5Q1EETapn32yKNt3c3i1sn.jpg"},{"name":"Yumarie Morales","character":"Sasha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wayqCpuQJVR0Ps9cMr8cmGp2gfz.jpg"},{"name":"Marlene Forte","character":"Mom","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qBhO3tT3VzF1bxUhw3ylmQsfTwP.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Doubek","character":"Dad","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/av06AVYfFQ9tl365fsqRqbyCs29.jpg"},{"name":"Paget Brewster","character":"Dr. Samp